.SH RETURN VALUE
\f[B]ibv_alloc_dmah()\f[R] returns a pointer to the allocated dma handle
object, or NULL if the request fails.
.PP
\f[B]ibv_dealloc_dmah()\f[R] returns 0 upon success, otherwise the errno
